{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41903","headline":"赠海上书记张济员外 · 李中","name":"赠海上书记张济员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹏霄休叹志难伸，贫病虽萦道且存。\n阮瑀不能专笔砚，嵇康唯要乐琴尊。\n春风满院空欹枕，芳草侵堦独闭门。\n劒有尘埃书有蠹，昔年心事共谁论。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41903.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41903","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}